  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We are given an m by n matrix, here.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2960,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 89,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "m is the number of rows and n is the number of columns.",
      "start_ms": 3420,
      "end_ms": 7060,
      "start_frame": 103,
      "end_frame": 212,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "So the matrix does not have to be square.",
      "start_ms": 7540,
      "end_ms": 9640,
      "start_frame": 226,
      "end_frame": 289,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "For this lesson, we will use this 5 by 6 matrix.",
      "start_ms": 10660,
      "end_ms": 14180,
      "start_frame": 320,
      "end_frame": 425,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Our job is to return all m times n values, in one list, following spiral order.",
      "start_ms": 14820,
      "end_ms": 22340,
      "start_frame": 445,
      "end_frame": 670,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "That order moves right, down, left, up and then repeats.",
      "start_ms": 23020,
      "end_ms": 28560,
      "start_frame": 691,
      "end_frame": 857,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But the real question is, when should we turn?",
      "start_ms": 28560,
      "end_ms": 31840,
      "start_frame": 857,
      "end_frame": 955,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose we are moving right.",
      "start_ms": 32520,
      "end_ms": 34200,
      "start_frame": 976,
      "end_frame": 1026,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "If the next position goes outside the matrix, we obviously need to turn.",
      "start_ms": 34620,
      "end_ms": 39680,
      "start_frame": 1039,
      "end_frame": 1190,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "But after completing the outer part, the next position may still be inside the matrix, and already visited.",
      "start_ms": 40160,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "start_frame": 1205,
      "end_frame": 1424,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "So method 1 uses one simple rule.",
      "start_ms": 48080,
      "end_ms": 50980,
      "start_frame": 1442,
      "end_frame": 1529,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn when the next position is outside the matrix, or already visited.",
      "start_ms": 50980,
      "end_ms": 57760,
      "start_frame": 1529,
      "end_frame": 1733,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "To do that, we keep the current position, the current direction and a visited matrix.",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 65460,
      "start_frame": 1757,
      "end_frame": 1964,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's trace it properly.",
      "start_ms": 65780,
      "end_ms": 67540,
      "start_frame": 1973,
      "end_frame": 2026,
      "word_count": 5
    }
  ],
